        "diff": "@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@\n+stages: [deploy]\n+\n+deploy-staging:\n+  stage: deploy\n+  script: ./deploy.sh staging\n+  rules:\n+    - if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == \"main\"\n+\n+deploy-production:\n+  stage: deploy\n+  script: ./deploy.sh production\n+  rules:\n+    - if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG =~ /^v\\d+/\n+  when: on_success\n",
